@KorridorX_HostAddress = http://localhost:5112

GET {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get available funding methods for a transfer
GET {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/collection-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a collection for a transfer
POST {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/collections
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentMethod": 4
}

### Get a transfer collection
GET {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/transfers/{{transferId}}/collection
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get my collections
GET {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/collections?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Synchronize current customer with Blaaiz
POST {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/customer-profile/me/provider/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idType": "passport",
  "idNumber": "REPLACE_WITH_TEST_ID_NUMBER",
  "idIssueDate": "2024-01-01",
  "idExpiryDate": "2030-01-01"
}

### Refresh/retrieve synchronized provider customer status
POST {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/customer-profile/me/provider/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Initiate an Interac collection
POST {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/collections/{{collectionId}}/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payerEmail": "payer@example.com",
  "customerName": "Test Payer",
  "interacExpiryHours": 48
}

### Initiate a card collection
# Card details are transmitted directly to Blaaiz and are never persisted by KorridorX.
POST {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/collections/{{collectionId}}/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "redirectUrl": "https://example.com/payment/callback",
  "card": {
    "cardHolderName": "Test Customer",
    "cardNumber": "REPLACE_WITH_PROVIDER_TEST_CARD",
    "expiry": "12/30",
    "cvc": "123"
  }
}

### Blaaiz OAuth health check (Admin/SuperAdmin)
GET {{KorridorX_HostAddress}}/api/providers/blaaiz/health
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
